{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dr. Diogenes is back, but this time the real threat comes from beyond the stars: an alien invasion seeking to conquer the Earth. The Basureroes must prepare to spring into action and save the world. Once again, it's time to take out the trash! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955850/extras/01.gif?t=1742283280\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u201cBasureroes: Invasion\u201d</strong> is a 2D platform game with retro aesthetics in which a group of heroes with different abilities must save the world from an alien invasion. Run, jump and fight your way through twenty levels full of danger and epic boss fights.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955850/extras/02.gif?t=1742283280\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Retro visual style that pays homage to the classic action platformers of yesteryear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Precise control and gameplay adapted to current times</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Six different game modes will unlock as you progress: story, time attack, battle, boss rush, survival, and training. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Increasing difficulty (not everything is going to be a walk around the city!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Original soundtrack with more than thirty different themes, with a retro but modern touch.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Endearing characters and light narrative in a science fiction and superhero story for all audiences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A group of heroes with different abilities: running, jumping and sliding is just the beginning</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A score of levels full of enemies and obstacles with varied environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An epic battle against a final boss awaits at the end of each level </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Five people and a little lost puppy are waiting to be saved in (almost) each level. Only our h\u00e9roes can do it!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some special levels: pilot a spaceship, drive a motorcycle or control a mine cart</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Local cooperative multiplayer mode for up to four players</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955850/extras/03.gif?t=1742283280\" /></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The invasion starts","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1955850/dd24061cc6b8b0b9a78a2c4f6cd3461466b15029.jpg"},{"name":"That's no way to make friends","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1955850/e36cd0bda093e07427853e2fb130b811e0829472.jpg"},{"name":"Masked versus Dark","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1955850/4f6a8573cfa1bc13f721dfd5974f6ce81fe5cff5.jpg"},{"name":"We've already finished?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1955850/cb5471b58116e51ad8e8eb5c5dc8acc9702aa4ea.jpg"},{"name":"Labyrinth Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1955850/d9307a3e44cdaccfdcccf91cf305ef854ebadaf7.jpg"},{"name":"Excess baggage","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1955850/181dfc7525a387af2916891ba0937436af9bb175.jpg"},{"name":"Main team reunited","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1955850/55c46cdd5960536129759a127f7d281ce33624fe.jpg"},{"name":"Heroes from the past","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/stea